ry></item><item><title>腔 QED 接口</title><link>https://ustc-iontrap.github.io/zh/gallery/cavity-qed-interface.html</link><description>从镀金光纤腔镜到针状离子阱集成，构建兼具高带宽与高效率的离子—光子量子接口。</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">qng</dc:creator><pubDate>Sat, 28 Mar 2026 10:20:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>tag:ustc-iontrap.github.io,2026-03-28:/zh/gallery/cavity-qed-interface.html</guid><category>gallery</category></item><item><title>横向偏振梯度离子纠缠门成果发表于 Physical Review Letters，并获编辑推荐</title><link>https://ustc-iontrap.github.io/zh/transverse-polarization-gradient-entangling-gates-trapped-ion.html</link><description>利用紧聚焦光场的横向偏振梯度实现离子纠缠门，简化光路并兼容光镊架构。成果发表于 Physical Review Letters，获编辑推荐。</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">qng</dc:creator><pubDate>Thu, 25 Dec 2025 10:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>tag:ustc-iontrap.github.io,2025-12-25:/zh/transverse-polarization-gradient-entangling-gates-trapped-ion.html</guid><category>News</category></item><item><title>“神经网络辅助的 ¹⁷¹Yb⁺ 量子磁力计”发表于 npj Quantum Information</title><link>https://ustc-iontrap.github.io/zh/neural-network-assisted-yb-quantum-magnetometer.html</link><description>将神经网络引入囚禁离子磁力计的数据处理，在散粒噪声与连续单次测量条件下提取射频场参数，成果发表于 npj Quantum Information。</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">qng</dc:creator><pubDate>Thu, 22 Dec 2022 10:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>tag:ustc-iontrap.github.io,2022-12-22:/zh/neural-network-assisted-yb-quantum-magnetometer.html</guid><category>News</category></item><item><title>“单冷原子的纳秒尺度超分辨成像”发表于 Physical Review Letters</title><link>https://ustc-iontrap.github.io/zh/super-resolved-imaging-single-cold-atom-nanosecond.html</link><description>将基态耗尽显微成像引入离子阱系统，实现单离子的二维超分辨成像与纳秒尺度频闪探测。成果发表于 Physical Review Letters。</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">qng</dc:creator><pubDate>Fri, 24 Dec 2021 10:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>tag:ustc-iontrap.github.io,2021-12-24:/zh/super-resolved-imaging-single-cold-atom-nanosecond.html</guid><category>News</category></item><item><title>利用离子量子比特的 Floquet 工程测量黎曼零点，成果发表于 npj Quantum Information</title><link>https://ustc-iontrap.github.io/zh/riemann-zeros-floquet-engineering-trapped-ion.html</link><description>通过周期驱动囚禁离子量子比特，利用 Floquet 动力学测量黎曼零点，连接量子物理与数论。成果发表于 npj Quantum Information。</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">qng</dc:creator><pubDate>Thu, 01 Jul 2021 10:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>tag:ustc-iontrap.github.io,2021-07-01:/zh/riemann-zeros-floquet-engineering-trapped-ion.html</guid><category>News</category></item><item><title>绝热开放系统量子热力学的离子阱实验发表于 npj Quantum Information</title><link>https://ustc-iontrap.github.io/zh/quantum-thermodynamics-adiabatic-open-systems-trapped-ion.html</link><description>建立绝热开放系统中热、功、内能与熵的一般公式，利用离子阱实验研究量子绝热过程与热力学绝热过程的关系。成果发表于 npj Quantum Information。</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">qng</dc:creator><pubDate>Fri, 18 Sep 2020 10:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>tag:ustc-iontrap.github.io,2020-09-18:/zh/quantum-thermodynamics-adiabatic-open-systems-trapped-ion.html</guid><category>News</category></item><item><title>超越 Kibble–Zurek 机制的量子临界动力学实验发表于 Communications Physics</title><link>https://ustc-iontrap.github.io/zh/experimentally-testing-quantum-critical-dynamics-beyond-kibble-zurek.html</link><description>利用单个囚禁离子重建量子相变中拓扑缺陷的完整概率分布，检验超越平均缺陷数量的普适临界动力学。成果发表于 Communications Physics。</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">qng</dc:creator><pubDate>Fri, 14 Feb 2020 10:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>tag:ustc-iontrap.github.io,2020-02-14:/zh/experimentally-testing-quantum-critical-dynamics-beyond-kibble-zurek.html</guid><category>News</category></item><item><title>抑制残余几何退相干的实验成果发表于 Science Bulletin</title><link>https://ustc-iontrap.github.io/zh/experimental-demonstration-suppressing-residual-geometric-dephasing.html</link><description>在单个囚禁离子上验证改进的动力学解耦序列，抑制传统自旋回波与 CPMG 序列中的残余几何退相干。成果发表于 Science Bulletin。</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">qng</dc:creator><pubDate>Fri, 20 Sep 2019 10:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>tag:ustc-iontrap.github.io,2019-09-20:/zh/experimental-demonstration-suppressing-residual-geometric-dephasing.html</guid><category>News</category></item><item><title>用于囚禁离子荧光收集的紫外光纤微腔成果发表于 Chinese Physics Letters</title><link>https://ustc-iontrap.github.io/zh/an-ultraviolet-fiber-fabry-perot-cavity-for-florescence-collection-of-trapped-ions-is-published.html</link><description>研制工作在 369 nm 紫外波段的光纤 Fabry–Pérot 微腔，用于增强镱离子的荧光收集，为远程量子连接提供器件基础。成果发表于 Chinese Physics Letters。</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">qng</dc:creator><pubDate>Sun, 22 Jan 2017 10:20:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>tag:ustc-iontrap.github.io,2017-01-22:/zh/an-ultraviolet-fiber-fabry-perot-cavity-for-florescence-collection-of-trapped-ions-is-published.html</guid><category>News</category></item><item><title>“动量空间中 Kibble–Zurek 动力学的离子阱量子模拟实验”发表</title><link>https://ustc-iontrap.github.io/zh/experimental-trapped-ion-quantum-simulation-of-the-kibble-zurek-dynamics-in-momentum-space-is-published.html</link><description>研究组首项离子阱实验成果发表于 Scientific Reports：在动量空间模拟量子 Ising 链，实验检验量子区域的 Kibble–Zurek 标度规律。</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">qng</dc:creator><pubDate>Thu, 22 Sep 2016 10:20:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>tag:ustc-iontrap.github.io,2016-09-22:/zh/experimental-trapped-ion-quantum-simulation-of-the-kibble-zurek-dynamics-in-momentum-space-is-published.html</guid><category>News</category></item></channel></rss>